Wen Counter
An open point of sale on Solana Pay, part of the Wen Open Lab (Model 7).
https://wen-watt.github.io/lab/counter.html

Built by the Wen Almanac community on the open Wen chain:
Solana (network) · Solana Pay (payment request standard) · SPL Token and Token-2022 (token programs)
· WNS, the Wen New Standard (open NFT standard and SDKs) · WEN (the community token).

Attribution required for copies and derivative works (Apache License 2.0, section 4(d)):
keep this NOTICE file, and credit "Wen Open Lab · wen-watt.github.io" in your documentation
or in an "About" screen of your build.

Protocol: Wen Counter Protocol 1.0 (WCP-1) — receive-only, read-only in code, five-point verification,
wallet as identity, local ledger.

