Free: nothing is charged and there is no intermediary. You use the solution on your own responsibility:
you are responsible for your business, your records, your declarations and your taxes under the rules
of your country. The mechanism does not take money, does not hold money and does not charge a fee;
it follows the rules of the Solana network. Interface words live in counter-i18n.js, bound to the
fingerprint of counter-core.js. counter-deploy.js holds deployment parameters only (the first setup
PIN, default 1111) and is not fingerprinted: change it for your own counter.

